values ('Longines Global Champions Tour Cairo 2026: Giza, Cairo, 2026-10-22 to 2026-10-24', 'The Longines Global Champions Tour, the international show-jumping series, holds its first event in Egypt at the Pyramids of Giza from 22 to 24 October 2026, the first year of a five-year agreement.', 'CALENDAR_EVENT', 'SPORTS', 'EGYPT', 'QUALIFIED', 'NEW', 'SOURCE_BACKED', 'Claude (Private Calendar research, 4 Oct 2026)', 'VERIFIED', 'EGYPT', 'Giza, Cairo', 'Pyramids of Giza', 'Egypt', 'Giza, Cairo', '2026-10-22', '2026-10-24', 'https://www.gcglobalchampions.com/news/lgct-2026', 'Longines Global Champions Tour', '2026-10-04', 85, 100, 70, 80, 'lgct-cairo-2026', 'calendarEvent.lgct-cairo-2026', 'lgct-cairo|2026-10', 'Dates checked on 4 Oct 2026 on the organiser''s site (2026 calendar: 22–24 October). Launched in Cairo with the Prime Minister; five-year agreement, so 2027 is likely (watch). Act now: 18 days away. Awaiting CEO approval. Scores: initial NOYA judgement.')
